        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Aaron Latham, James Bridges, John Travolta\n- Works: Urban Cowboy, Urban Chipmunk, Saturday Night Fever, Grease\n- Topics: journalism, film inspiration, parody\n\nFacts:\n- Aaron Latham was born on October 3, 1943.\n- Aaron Latham is an American journalist who wrote the article that inspired the film \"Urban Cowboy.\"\n- Aaron Latham co-wrote the script for \"Urban Cowboy\" with director James Bridges.\n- \"Urban Cowboy\" was John Travolta's third major acting role after \"Saturday Night Fever\" and \"Grease.\"\n- \"Urban Chipmunk\" is titled as a parody of the 1980 film \"Urban Cowboy.\"",
